        {
          "text": "Ajana ba bagabisha bagaba amajana, n’abaganwa, n’abagaba abantu, n’abantu bose bo mu gihugu; basohokana umwami mu ngoro y’Uhoraho, baramumanukana, bajana inzira ica mu kirimba co haruguru, bamushikana mu ngoro i bgami; baraheza bamushira ku ntebe y’ubgami. ",
          "type": "text",
